{"id":"vod_bf_44548","vodId":"44548","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"在盛夏等待","name_cn":"在盛夏等待","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-45/42b3cc555f72e50399ce9577347c18a6.jpg"},"summary":"为了纪念着一去不复返的夏天，喜爱摄影的少年雾岛海人（岛崎信长 配音）决定和朋友们自导自演一部影片。正当影片准备动工之时，陌生女孩贵月一花（户松遥 配音）的身影吸引了海人的视线。海人被一花的外表和性格深深的吸引着，而这位行为举止有些怪异的转学生似乎隐藏着什么不可告人的秘密。　　长相幼稚身材却姣好的谷川柑菜（石原夏织 配音），成熟稳重的石垣哲朗（荻原秀树 配音），性格胆小容易害羞的北原美樱（阿澄佳奈 配音），个性诡异不可琢磨的山乃柠檬（田村由加莉 配音），无论结局怎样，在这样的盛夏，和朋友们在一起度过的每一天，都将成为海人无法忘却的珍贵记忆。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-29 23:12:33","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zaishengxiadengdai/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zaishengxiadengdai/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zaishengxiadengdai/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zaishengxiadengdai/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zaishengxiadengdai/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zaishengxiadengdai/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zaishengxiadengdai/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zaishengxiadengdai/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zaishengxiadengdai/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zaishengxiadengdai/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zaishengxiadengdai/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/zaishengxiadengdai/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:35:23.136Z"}